  - m_Id: 1289637892
    m_Localized: VR Museum
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637893
    m_Localized: 01  /  Align and explore the site
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637894
    m_Localized: 02  /  Travel through the virtual tour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637895
    m_Localized: 03  /  Discover the museum collection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637896
    m_Localized: '<b>1  PLACE THE OUTLINE</b>

      Hold the RIGHT GRIP and move
      the controller to match the outline to the real entrance sign/table.


      <b>2 
      ADJUST THE ALIGNMENT</b>

      While holding grip, move the right stick left/right
      to rotate, or up/down to adjust reach. Match the edges and height.


      <b>3 
      CONFIRM</b>

      Release grip, then press A. Wait for the alignment to lock.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637897
    m_Localized: '<b>EXPLORE THE RESTORATION</b>

      After alignment, press A
      to show or hide the model. Press B to show or hide site information; use its
      page buttons to read more.


      <b>REALIGN</b>

      Hold X for two seconds
      to place the reference again.


      <b>RETURN HOME</b>

      Tap X to show
      confirmation, then tap X again while it is visible. You can also use Home on
      the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637898
    m_Localized: '<b>CHOOSE A DESTINATION</b>

      Select an area from the tour
      menu to begin.


      <b>MOVE TO ANOTHER VIEWPOINT</b>

      Push the LEFT
      STICK forward and aim the arc at a navigation arrow. Release the stick when
      the arrow is highlighted to travel there.


      <b>CANCEL A MOVE</b>

      Pull
      the left stick backward. Releasing without a selected arrow also cancels.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637899
    m_Localized: '<b>LOOK CLOSER</b>

      Hold B to zoom in; hold A to zoom out.


      <b>INSPECT
      A RECONSTRUCTION</b>

      Where available, press Y to enter or leave reconstruction
      inspection. Press X to leave inspection. Navigation pauses during inspection.


      <b>LEAVE
      THE TOUR</b>

      Press X outside inspection to return to the tour menu.
      From there, tap X twice when prompted to return Home, or use the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637900
    m_Localized: '<b>EXPLORE THE GALLERY</b>

      Use the left stick to move and
      the right stick to turn. Look toward an exhibit to find its information icon.


      <b>INSPECT
      AN ARTIFACT</b>

      Point at the exhibit''s information icon and press the
      index trigger.


      <b>ROTATE THE ARTIFACT</b>

      During inspection,
      grip the artifact with either controller and move your hand to rotate it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637901
    m_Localized: '<b>ZOOM AND COMPARE</b>

      Hold B to enlarge the artifact;
      hold A to reduce it. Press Y to switch models when an alternate version is
      available.


      <b>CONTINUE EXPLORING</b>

      Press X to leave inspection.
      Movement resumes after you exit.


      <b>RETURN HOME</b>

      Outside
      inspection, tap X and then tap again at the confirmation, or select Home on
      the tablet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1289637902
    m_Localized: "<b>TABLET</b>  Left Menu: open / hide  \u2022  Home: main menu 
      \u2022  Change Language: English / Thai\n<b>AI CHAT BOT</b>  Type a question
      or use Speak, then Send. Clear resets the conversation.\n<b>SELECT</b>  Point
      at a button and press the index trigger."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
